    <tr><td><strong>Final Project Evaluation</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>1</td><td><strong>20%</strong></td><td>4</td><td>30' per group (9 groups per class × 0.5h = 4.5h)</td><td>CLO1–CLO6</td><td>Oral — the panel's comments and questions</td></tr>
